      "message": "Let\u0027s make it so that this commit compiles on its own. To do that we need a default implementation for `fp_sensor_get_info_v2`. You can add something like the following to `fpsensor.cc`:\n\n```\n__overridable int fp_sensor_get_info_v2(struct ec_response_fp_info_v2 *resp)\n{\n\t*resp \u003d {\n\t\t.sensor_info \u003d  { .vendor_id \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t      .product_id \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t      .model_id \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t      .version \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t      .num_capture_types \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t      .errors \u003d 0 },\n\t\t.template_info \u003d {\n\t\t\t.template_size \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t.template_max \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t.template_valid \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t.template_dirty \u003d 0,\n\t\t\t.template_version \u003d 0,\n\t\t},\n\t};\n\treturn EC_SUCCESS;\n}\n```",
